        loading="lazy"
        alt="The Valle Lunga map: a railway hut, rows of trees, bridge, pond and cutting, with observations written in Italian."
      />
      </a>
      <figcaption>The first sheet contains the map and observations. This example is in Italian.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
